    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configure before use\nSelect OpenRouter credentials and Firecrawl HTTP Bearer Auth; set FIRECRAWL_MCP_URL to a streamable HTTP endpoint exposing firecrawl_search and firecrawl_scrape. For hosted Firecrawl, use the endpoint/auth format supplied by your Firecrawl account.\nOptional: HUNTER_ENABLED=true and an HTTP Query Auth credential with Name=api_key. Otherwise Hunter is never executed. Enrichment failures keep source evidence and return a warning.\nAll results require source URLs. The requested model ID is configurable and may be billed by OpenRouter; verify current pricing. No email is sent.",
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "ce96a0c0-6bed-4218-8fa7-fbd51bd20bfb",
      "name": "Setup and Operating Notes",
